# Release signing. The keystore is the app's identity and cannot be replaced:
# back it up somewhere durable, but never commit it. Credentials live in
# ~/.gradle/gradle.properties, outside the project entirely - see
# docs/releasing.md. keystore.properties is no longer read by the build, but
# stays ignored so an old one left lying around can't be committed by mistake.
/keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
